{"id":193,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>中北大学半导体与物理学院2023年“刘鼎杯”大学生创新创业大赛立项评审会已结束。根据《关于组织开展2023年“刘鼎杯”大学生创新创业大赛的通知》要求，经团队申报—学院审核—组织答辩，最终评选出优秀作品6项，拟报到校团委，现将名单公示如下，公示期为3月14日-3月17日，在此期间若有异议请联系王老师，地点：主楼205办公室，电话：3921786。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=ZLzLbYL4GDMz-sUE4WRM7QkM7nVMRLesUNrVU4UPUNCinlC0gihFp2hmCIa0U1yPL1y4USh2ozNYMR7sMRl4UzCaMmnfLzN4o7n2nRA2nzWFnRfkoRQkL4fFLzvaLR-Jv2bjo4OeoDWN6dTspdAbgDTJQty0LzG4M1yPMmlPgtA8pUycc&oid=1879695507&tid=1036&nid=1651&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/B123AF992417453A6064A1938DFD8FE2/D0B86B30/17002\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=ZLzLbYL4GDMz-sUE4WRM7QkM7nVMRLesUNrVU4UPUNCinlC0gihFp2hmCIa0U1yPL1y4USh2ozNYMR7sMRl4UzCaMmnfLzN4o7n2nRA2nzWFnRfkoRQkL4fFLzvaLR-Jv2bjo4OeoDWN6dTspdAbgDTJQty0LzG4M1yPMmlPgtA8pUycc&oid=1879695507&tid=1036&nid=1651&e=.png\"></p></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://bdtywlxy.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=ZLzLbYL4GDMz-sUE4WRM7QkM7nVMRLesUNrVU4UPUNCinlC0gihFp2hmCIa0U1yPL1y4USh2ozNYMR7sMRl4UzCaMmnfLzN4o7n2nRA2nzWFnRfkoRQkL4fFLzvaLR-Jv2bjo4OeoDWN6dTspdAbgDTJQty0LzG4M1yPMmlPgtA8pUycc&oid=1879695507&tid=1036&nid=1651&e=.png"}